  "description": "The men’s Caferacer Solo is a beautiful, classic bike with modern functions. It has all the features you need to ride every day with speed and comfort with a comfy Creme saddle and grips. A new, lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame and fork with invest cast crown comes with a lifetime warranty. The bike is full of great parts that will ensure smooth and efficient functioning. This version has a 7-speed Shimano Nexus internal gear hub that offers a wide range and clean and service-free use for years. Driven by an Aluminium Creme Crankset. Fitted with Innova tyres 700x35C. Safety at night thanks to front and rear STVZO battery LED lights. Durable paint in Midnight and Black.",
